{%- comment -%}
  custom-collections — the category panels. Engagement, wedding, eternity, and
  whatever ranges come next.

  1 use: index. The main route off the homepage into the ranges.

  THREE EQUAL PANELS IN A ROW, matching live. My first pass built one tall
  panel plus two stacked, which is what the `left_` / `top_` / `bottom_`
  setting names imply — but live is a simple row, and a row is what takes a
  fourth and fifth range without a redesign. Ed's reason for wanting live's
  layout: more product types are coming.

  **Matching the live layout is the rule when porting. Do not redesign a
  section on the way across.**

  TWO WAYS TO FILL IT
  - `panel` BLOCKS — the normal way now. Add as many as the range list needs;
    the row divides evenly and wraps below 900px.
  - The legacy `left_*` / `top_*` / `bottom_*` SETTINGS — used when there are
    no blocks. Those IDs are frozen (index.json still carries them), so the
    section renders them as three equal panels rather than breaking. Once the
    template is moved to blocks, they can go.

  LABELS BELOW THE PHOTO (homepage once-over, Claude Design handoff
  11/10/2026). The heading and link used to sit bottom-left over a dark
  gradient; the design system does not allow gradient overlays, so the photo
  now stands clean at 4:3 and the words sit underneath it: heading in Tenor
  at h4, link as the underlined uppercase .link. A hairline above the row
  binds it to the trust strip as one shop block. Four panels on the homepage
  since bracelets went live; the row is auto-fit, 2 x 2 on a phone.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign ground = s.ground | default: 'white'
  assign panel_count = 0
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'panel'
      assign panel_count = panel_count | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
-%}

<section class="ccols band band--{{ ground }}" data-screen-label="Category panels">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ccols__row">

      {%- if panel_count > 0 -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.type != 'panel' -%}{% continue %}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign b = block.settings -%}
          {%- if b.heading != blank or b.image != blank -%}
            <a class="ccols__panel" href="{{ b.link | default: '#' }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- if b.image != blank -%}
                <span class="ccols__media">
                {{- b.image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag:
                   loading: 'lazy', widths: '400,600,800,1000',
                   sizes: '(max-width: 560px) 50vw, (max-width: 900px) 50vw, 25vw',
                   alt: b.heading, class: 'ccols__img' -}}
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="ccols__words">
                {%- if b.heading != blank -%}
                  <span class="ccols__heading">{{ b.heading }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if b.btn != blank -%}
                  <span class="link ccols__link">{{ b.btn }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}

      {%- else -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Legacy path: the three frozen setting groups, rendered as equal
          panels. Written out rather than looped — three unrelated prefixes and
          string-built keys would be harder to follow than the repetition.
        {%- endcomment -%}

        {%- if s.left_heading != blank or s.left_image != blank -%}
          <a class="ccols__panel" href="{{ s.left_link | default: '#' }}">
            {%- if s.left_image != blank -%}
              {{ s.left_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag:
                 loading: 'lazy', widths: '400,600,800,1000',
                 sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 33vw',
                 alt: s.left_heading, class: 'ccols__img' }}
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="ccols__words">
              {%- if s.left_heading != blank -%}<span class="ccols__heading">{{ s.left_heading }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if s.left_btn != blank -%}<span class="link ccols__link">{{ s.left_btn }}</span>{%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if s.top_heading != blank or s.top_image != blank -%}
          <a class="ccols__panel" href="{{ s.top_link | default: '#' }}">
            {%- if s.top_image != blank -%}
              {{ s.top_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag:
                 loading: 'lazy', widths: '400,600,800,1000',
                 sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 33vw',
                 alt: s.top_heading, class: 'ccols__img' }}
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="ccols__words">
              {%- if s.top_heading != blank -%}<span class="ccols__heading">{{ s.top_heading }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if s.top_btn != blank -%}<span class="link ccols__link">{{ s.top_btn }}</span>{%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if s.bottom_heading != blank or s.bottom_image != blank -%}
          <a class="ccols__panel" href="{{ s.bottom_link | default: '#' }}">
            {%- if s.bottom_image != blank -%}
              {{ s.bottom_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag:
                 loading: 'lazy', widths: '400,600,800,1000',
                 sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 33vw',
                 alt: s.bottom_heading, class: 'ccols__img' }}
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="ccols__words">
              {%- if s.bottom_heading != blank -%}<span class="ccols__heading">{{ s.bottom_heading }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if s.bottom_btn != blank -%}<span class="link ccols__link">{{ s.bottom_btn }}</span>{%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
/* auto-fit so a fifth range needs no setting change. The 150px floor lets four
   sit in one row from about 700px; 2 x 2 is forced below 768 so a phone never
   gets one long column of photographs. */
.fye .ccols__row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
  gap: var(--s9) var(--grid-gap);
  border-top: var(--hairline);
  padding-top: var(--s9);
}

.fye .ccols__panel {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--s4);
  color: var(--ink);
}
.fye .ccols__media {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--ivory);
}
/* The legacy setting path renders the img without the media wrapper. */
.fye .ccols__img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .ccols__panel:hover .ccols__img { transform: scale(1.03); }

.fye .ccols__words {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--s4);
}
.fye .ccols__heading {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--fs-h4);
  line-height: var(--lh-heading);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-h2);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .ccols__link { font-size: var(--fs-fine); }
.fye .ccols__panel:hover .ccols__heading,
.fye .ccols__panel:hover .ccols__link { color: var(--sage); }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .fye .ccols__row { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--s7) var(--s4); }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .fye .ccols__panel:hover .ccols__img { transform: none; }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Category panels",
  "max_blocks": 6,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "name": "Panel",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Image" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "btn", "label": "Link text", "default": "View our rings" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "link", "label": "Link" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Add a panel per range. The row divides evenly and wraps below 900px." },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "ground", "label": "Background", "default": "white",
      "options": [
        { "value": "white", "label": "White" },
        { "value": "ivory", "label": "Ivory" }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Legacy panels" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Used only while this section has no panel blocks. Add blocks and these stop rendering." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "left_image", "label": "Panel 1 image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "left_heading", "label": "Panel 1 heading" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "left_btn", "label": "Panel 1 link text" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "left_link", "label": "Panel 1 link" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "top_image", "label": "Panel 2 image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "top_heading", "label": "Panel 2 heading" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "top_btn", "label": "Panel 2 link text" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "top_link", "label": "Panel 2 link" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "bottom_image", "label": "Panel 3 image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "bottom_heading", "label": "Panel 3 heading" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "bottom_btn", "label": "Panel 3 link text" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "bottom_link", "label": "Panel 3 link" }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Category panels", "blocks": [{ "type": "panel" }, { "type": "panel" }, { "type": "panel" }] }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
